.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
# The public /v1 process's environment (`npm run dev:public`, `npm run keys`).
# It names API_KEYS_DB_PATH — the file holding hashed API keys — so it is
# ignored for the same reason `.env` is. `server/.env.public.example` is the
# committed template. The line above does NOT cover this: `.env.*.local`
# matches `.env.public.local`, not `.env.public` (ABL-300).
.env.public

# TypeScript incremental build cache — churns on every build, not source
*.tsbuildinfo

